{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e9133c7b716ccdd6649ba13724b81b6f6e0da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />, side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46c5477876d1869fc01708e8acbe11b1231514f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, and side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0aa83ecac559034b9c1a9fb9fd48f43ba826614.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the largest number such that the magnitude, \nin degrees, of the angle opposite side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e512c0be99f948b92e30dec90690b73281cc62a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 150^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 120^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 105^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 90^{\\circ} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"458\" height=\"17\" />     \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Cosines\" title=\"Law of Cosines\">Law of Cosines</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a0b20d0c459fbdd295ec546027773c964435fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{3 + 3 - 2\\cdot 3 \\cdot \\cos{x^\\circ}}&gt;3\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Both sides are positive, so squaring both sides will not affect the inequality.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/149da099213ed7c3dac9b85bfdd2b420ff895800.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6 - 6 \\cos{x^\\circ}&gt;9\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/a/88a6c7ed078b30ff7b7b34bb07901cdd1be0572c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos{x^\\circ} &lt; -\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c342bdfb6498724e396d65214c103f83198d4667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{120^\\circ} = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"112\" height=\"37\" />.  As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> gets closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c9cfae39cb378f17672726fb1de7705b94a6da4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos{x}$\" width=\"37\" height=\"8\" /> decreases towards <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c07ba129abd55a96a0a397ccb4df8e1df63605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"16\" />, and in order to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the answer has to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1